    <verbatim|codex/existence-monograph> at
    <verbatim|a2353123c27d800b4ea92a1cf62ad645d94e91fe>.

    <item>Scope: compare the legacy Roll chain with the public native
    selector and check its joins to the common-funded, common-observable,
    common-scale, and OPE-history chapters.

    <item>Permitted output: this audit only. No Lean or manuscript source was
